OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on benefits
OL,4,Aand Brexit vote claims at PMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is facing questions from
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch as Prime Minister's
OL,8,FQuestions returns - watch live above
OL,10,FThe PM has been pressed on his claims
OL,11,Fof Russian interference in the 2016
OL,12,FBrexit referendum
OL,14,FBurnham also tells MPs that Manchester
OL,15,FCity did not raise the issue of the
OL,16,FPremier League financial charges with
OL,17,Fhim or his team
OL,19,FIt is the first PMQs since September,
OL,20,Fas MPs were away from Westminster for
OL,21,Fnearly four weeks due to the party
OL,22,Fconference season recess
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
